over there.

419
00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:41.674
Oh, heck no.
Not on my watch.

420
00:17:41.676 --> 00:17:42.877
Appreciate the tip.

421
00:17:48.248 --> 00:17:50.248
So, all we gotta do
is find this eboy place.

422
00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:51.851
- Ebay.
- Right, ebay.

423
00:17:51.853 --> 00:17:54.186
So we go there,
get the steering wheel...

424
00:17:54.188 --> 00:17:55.688
