444
00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:34.861
Ooh. Did you hear that, kid?
Sweet echo.

445
00:18:34.863 --> 00:18:36.328
Check this out.

446
00:18:39.534 --> 00:18:42.402
Hoolie-hoo!
Hoolie-hoo!

447
00:18:42.404 --> 00:18:44.604
Okay, connect to network.

448
00:18:44.606 --> 00:18:46.706
