449
00:18:46.708 --> 00:18:50.779
Password is "high score"
with a zero instead of an "o."

450
00:18:51.446 --> 00:18:52.612
Yes.

451
00:18:52.614 --> 00:18:54.849
And we are online.

452
00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:03.990
Hoolie-hoo!

453
00:19:03.992 --> 00:19:06.592
Hoolie-hoolie-hoo!

454
00:19:06.594 --> 00:19:08.294
