474
00:20:47.963 --> 00:20:49.997
Whoa!

475
00:20:49.999 --> 00:20:52.465
Kid, I don't think
we're in Litwak's anymore.

476
00:20:52.467 --> 00:20:55.434
We most certainly
are not, friendo.

477
00:20:55.436 --> 00:20:58.540
